---
description: Conservative proofs for regex, map, cipher, proxy and version checks
globs: gixy/plugins/regex_redos.py,gixy/plugins/weak_ssl_tls.py,gixy/plugins/http_splitting.py,gixy/plugins/quic_bpf_reuseport.py,gixy/core/variable.py,gixy/core/config.py,gixy/core/nginx_flavors.py,gixy/cli/nginx_version.py
alwaysApply: false
---

- @gixy/plugins/regex_redos.py uses bounded finite/cofinite FIRST sets and
  nullable tails. Unsupported sets cannot prove disjointness; never execute a
  supplied regex with Python's backtracking matcher.
- @gixy/plugins/weak_ssl_tls.py evaluates OpenSSL cipher commands symbolically.
  A broad or unknown positive selector retains an opaque weak possibility until
  a documented exclusion covers its entire family. Never use host OpenSSL
  availability as a scanner safety proof.
- @gixy/core/variable.py bounds map captures by the whole source alphabet,
  including literals. Capture keys belong to one map entry, including entries
  expanded from includes. Missing variables and cycles cannot prove safety.
- @gixy/plugins/http_splitting.py proves proxy URI safety over every local
  rewrite path, including `break` skipping a later `return`. Directive source
  order is not proxy execution order. Unsupported mutations remain warnings.
- @gixy/core/config.py shares one target identity for CVE and QUIC checks.
  Global input wins over the legacy fallback; invalid or failed `auto` remains
  unknown. Core/library paths never execute subprocesses.
- Only the local CLI's explicit `nginx-version = auto` opt-in may run
  @gixy/cli/nginx_version.py's bounded `nginx -V` probe, once before Config and
  the file loop. Reject auto in server mode before readiness; help/version/
  write-config never probe. Keep diagnostics on stderr.
- @gixy/core/nginx_flavors.py validates the packaged JSON registry and parses
  only version-banner lines. Preserve the advertised version. Unknown banners
  use upstream rules; explicit flavor wins. Vendor suppression requires a
  known version at/after an exact check/CVE key's evidenced fix threshold.
  Do not add code branches for individual vendors or package-manager queries.
- @scripts/check_analyzer_proof_mutations.py runs bounded security-proof
  mutations in temporary source copies. Each mutant must fail an observed
  assertion, never merely fail to import or collect.
